        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Neural: Forbidden</u></i></strong> is a first-person indie horror and puzzle game created by a single developer. You play as Natasha, a girl who wakes up in a gloomy place she doesn’t recognize at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/b5e5761cad11b7b1bf03bd4775a7ef5f.poster.avif?t=1762248480\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/b5e5761cad11b7b1bf03bd4775a7ef5f.webm?t=1762248480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Is that her father’s voice? What lies hidden deep within that senseless and dangerous place? It feels as if she’s still dreaming. You are seemingly alone, with only a camera as your source of light…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/7a08e299a761f09e8c245cc6109e120d.poster.avif?t=1762248480\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/7a08e299a761f09e8c245cc6109e120d.webm?t=1762248480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/7a08e299a761f09e8c245cc6109e120d.mp4?t=1762248480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Embark on this short horror experience to uncover what lies beneath.</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Help the protagonist unravel the mystery and uncover the truth behind it all... </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game aims to create an oppressive atmosphere and an immersive sound design to deliver a short but intense experience focused on psychology and personal discovery, with plot twists that will chill your blood.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/e24509065b02b450aa744280429cf1bc.poster.avif?t=1762248480\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/e24509065b02b450aa744280429cf1bc.webm?t=1762248480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/e24509065b02b450aa744280429cf1bc.mp4?t=1762248480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>For lovers of puzzles and enigmatic stories, the game blends different camera perspectives alongside first-person moments, creating scenes designed to chill and disturb you.</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Approximate duration: 1 hour.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This first- and third-person horror experience includes puzzle elements and a narrative featuring experienced voice actors.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developed in Argentina.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/1bffe4d0e06d165b230cb694032d2300.poster.avif?t=1762248480\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/1bffe4d0e06d165b230cb694032d2300.webm?t=1762248480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Neural: Forbidden</u></i></strong> is a first-person indie horror and puzzle game created by a single developer. You play as Natasha, a girl who wakes up in a gloomy place she doesn’t recognize at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/b5e5761cad11b7b1bf03bd4775a7ef5f.poster.avif?t=1762248480\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/b5e5761cad11b7b1bf03bd4775a7ef5f.webm?t=1762248480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Is that her father’s voice? What lies hidden deep within that senseless and dangerous place? It feels as if she’s still dreaming. You are seemingly alone, with only a camera as your source of light…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/7a08e299a761f09e8c245cc6109e120d.poster.avif?t=1762248480\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/7a08e299a761f09e8c245cc6109e120d.webm?t=1762248480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/7a08e299a761f09e8c245cc6109e120d.mp4?t=1762248480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Embark on this short horror experience to uncover what lies beneath.</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Help the protagonist unravel the mystery and uncover the truth behind it all... </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game aims to create an oppressive atmosphere and an immersive sound design to deliver a short but intense experience focused on psychology and personal discovery, with plot twists that will chill your blood.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/e24509065b02b450aa744280429cf1bc.poster.avif?t=1762248480\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/e24509065b02b450aa744280429cf1bc.webm?t=1762248480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/e24509065b02b450aa744280429cf1bc.mp4?t=1762248480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>For lovers of puzzles and enigmatic stories, the game blends different camera perspectives alongside first-person moments, creating scenes designed to chill and disturb you.</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Approximate duration: 1 hour.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This first- and third-person horror experience includes puzzle elements and a narrative featuring experienced voice actors.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developed in Argentina.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/1bffe4d0e06d165b230cb694032d2300.poster.avif?t=1762248480\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096020/extras/1bffe4d0e06d165b230cb694032d2300.webm?t=1762248480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
        "short_description": "Natasha descends into a place that doesn’t exist, shaped by guilt, fear, and memory. Among the ruins of thoughts and the echoes of a familiar voice, reality twists like a dream. - Where am I?... Dad? A psychological horror and puzzle game that seeks to disturb you before going to sleep.",
